  "description": "<p><strong>Brand Introduction:</strong><br>KIOKU is dedicated to making Japanese language learning accessible and efficient for beginners and advanced learners alike. Based in Tokyo, we started by creating Kanji flashcards for key JLPT levels. Today, we offer a range of products designed to support learners worldwide, combining traditional techniques with modern design.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Product Description:</strong><br>Our flagship KIOKU Kanji Cards are carefully curated to accelerate Japanese reading and writing skills. Crafted with durable, water-resistant materials, they are compact and travel-friendly, empowering learners to study anywhere. We also provide Hiragana/Katakana sets, posters, and unique wooden &ldquo;KIRIBAKO&rdquo; boxes for a complete study experience.</p>\r\n<p><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Comprehensive language tools for every JLPT level (N5 through N1).</li>\r\n<li>High-quality materials that withstand daily handling and travel.</li>\r\n<li>Unique packaging options (paper box or KIRIBAKO) combining aesthetics and durability.</li>\r\n<li>Designed by a passionate team of educators and Japanese language enthusiasts.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms:</strong><br>We offer competitive commissions on each successful sale through UpPromote. Payments are processed via PayPal on a monthly basis, ensuring timely and secure compensation for our affiliate partners.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Other Information:</strong><br>We welcome affiliates from around the world who are enthusiastic about Japanese language education. Our dedicated support team is available to answer questions, provide product updates, and share marketing assets. Join us in bringing innovative language-learning tools to learners everywhere!</p>",
